| `acme_rate_limited` | 429 | `both` | no (see note) | `caller` | -- | A certificate authority rate limit applies. May appear as operation.deferral_reason with an estimated_start days away. | Wait until {reset_at}; do not retry aggressively, because failed attempts consume the same budget. |
